<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11572] Node restart in ignite.sh was broken by IGNITE-11216</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11572</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;See TC tests in master:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_StartNodes&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeStatusDiv&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=%3Cdefault%3E&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_StartNodes&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeStatusDiv&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=%3Cdefault%3E&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;All node restart tests are failing because nodes stop, but not restarted. Looks like the changes in &lt;tt&gt;ignite.sh&lt;/tt&gt; caused the node restart loop to exit after the first &lt;tt&gt;CommandLineStartup&lt;/tt&gt; execution.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
